        "code": "import re\n\ntext = value or \"\"\ntext = re.sub(r\"h[xX]{2}p(s?)://\", lambda m: \"http\" + m.group(1) + \"://\", text)\ntext = text.replace(\"[.]\", \".\").replace(\"(.)\", \".\").replace(\"{.}\", \".\")\ntext = text.replace(\"[:]\", \":\").replace(\"[@]\", \"@\").replace(\"(@)\", \"@\")\ntext = re.sub(r\"\\[?\\bdot\\b\\]?\", \".\", text, flags=re.IGNORECASE)\nreturn text.strip()",
